### t0-even-odd
Count evens/odds. Negative numbers: `n % 2` gives -1 or 1 or 0, sign follows. Even iff n % 2 = 0.

```
Trepiho even := 0;
Trepiho odd := 0;
Trepiho line := Thoke();
Rokomi (line ~= Krupelro) {
    Trepiho n := Eshiyer(line);
    Mushu n % 2 = 0 Yeshil Hupo
        even := even + 1;
    Tho Thotri Hupo
        odd := odd + 1;
    Tho
    line := Thoke();
}
Rashar "even " + even;
Rashar "odd " + odd;
```

